The base layout is derived from Herdr main 0.1.12. The project-spaces,
project-tabs, project-files and project-changes mods are derived from
Herdr's bundled spaces, tabs, files and changes mods at 0.1.16.
Modifications add project opening, persistent project-root browsing,
English controls, staging/unstaging, and staged-only commits.
project-open, project-usage, their Python helpers, and the additional action
icons were created for this layout.

Orca inspired the project workflow. This is an independent Herdr layout.
